**Ресурсы по фазам:**

PoC (Months 1-3)
 - Team: 3-4 разработчика
 - Infrastructure: Развертывание на локальных серверах / cloud credits
 - Budget: $15K-25K (API credits, cloud resources, tools)

Pre-Production (Months 4-6)
 - Team: 5-6 разработчиков
 - Infrastructure: Kubernetes cluster, GPU nodes
 - Budget: $30K-50K (infrastructure scaling, additional tools)

Production (Months 7-8)
 - Team: 5-7 разработчиков + DevOps
 - Infrastructure: Production-grade cluster
 - Budget: $25K-40K (production infrastructure, monitoring)

Enterprise (Months 9-10)
 - Team: 6-8 разработчиков + продуктовые роли
 - Infrastructure: Multi-tenant, enterprise-grade
 - Budget: $35K-60K (advanced features, compliance)

**Total: $105K-175K за 10 месяцев**
